+ Saraṇattayaṃ Buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi; Dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi;
  Saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.

Dutiyampi buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi; Dutiyampi dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi;
Dutiyampi saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.

Tatiyampi buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi; Tatiyampi dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi;
Tatiyampi saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.

Saraṇattayaṃ \[saraṇagamanaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ (syā.)\] niṭṭhitaṃ.

